========================================================================
MODIFICATIONS
========================================================================

BlackBox-Neo adds the following changes on top of upstream BlackBox.
A full and authoritative list is available in the git history.

  * Android 17 (API 37) compatibility fixes:
      - AIDL signature changes (IServiceConnection.connected)
      - Application creation workaround for LoadedApk.makeApplication
      - Tinker (hot-fix) lock/inter-fence compatibility
      - ContentProvider installation via reflection

  * System-level fake location hardening:
      - Cellular: getCellLocation / getAllCellInfo /
        requestCellInfoUpdate (async, Android 12+) /
        TelephonyRegistry LISTEN_CELL_INFO
      - WiFi: getScanResults / getConnectionInfo / getConfiguredNetworks
      - GNSS: NMEA and raw measurements listeners
      - Location registration: registerLocationListener (Android 14+)
      - WGS-84 <-> GCJ-02 coordinate conversion in the picker UI

  * Map picker replaced with Tencent Map JavaScript API GL
      - API key and secret key are NOT bundled; they must be supplied
        by the user in the app settings.

========================================================================
THIRD-PARTY KEYS
========================================================================

This repository intentionally contains NO API keys, tokens, phone
numbers, or other credentials. Any third-party service key must be
provided by the user at runtime through the application settings.
